safix::refusal

  × Ana Smith is not a well-formed user name.
  │ 
  │ A user name is interpolated into the path of the file their secrets are
  │ placed in and into the path_regex of a .sops.yaml creation rule, so the
  │ alphabet excludes everything that could act as a path separator or as a
  │ regex metacharacter. A widened rule is how a sops updatekeys sweep
  │ reaches a file it was never meant to touch.
  │ 
  │ Names match [a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]*, anchored: lowercase letters and digits,
  │ then any of
  │ those plus underscore and hyphen.
